---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout 
	title="Pricing & Payouts — Bodhic AI"
	description="Learn about Bodhic AI's transparent pricing model. Creators keep an industry-leading 80% of sales, while buyers pay zero markup or conversion fees."
>
	<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; padding: var(--space-5xl) 0;">
		<span class="eyebrow" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; padding: 6px 16px; background: var(--primary-soft); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); border: 1px solid rgba(108, 60, 225, 0.15); display: inline-block; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">pricing</span>
		<h1 style="font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Simple, <span class="gradient-text">transparent</span> pricing.</h1>
		<p style="color: var(--body); font-size: 18px; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto;">No surprises. Fair splits for creators, zero markup for buyers.</p>

		<div class="grid" style="margin-top: var(--space-3xl); grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);">
			<div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-xl); text-align: left;">
				<div style="font-size: 13px; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">For Sellers</div>
				<div style="font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -2.5px; line-height: 1;">80%</div>
				<div style="color: var(--mute); font-size: 14px; margin-top: var(--space-xxs);">revenue per sale</div>
				<div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); margin: var(--space-lg) 0; padding-top: var(--space-lg);">
					<ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-sm); font-size: 14px; color: var(--body);">
						<li>✓ Direct UPI payouts in INR</li>
						<li>✓ Instant wallet crediting</li>
						<li>✓ Free security scanning</li>
						<li>✓ Marketplace listing</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<a href="/sell" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; margin-top: var(--space-lg);">Start Selling →</a>
			</div>
			<div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-xl); text-align: left;">
				<div style="font-size: 13px; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">For Buyers</div>
				<div style="font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -2.5px; line-height: 1;">₹0</div>
				<div style="color: var(--mute); font-size: 14px; margin-top: var(--space-xxs);">markup or hidden fees</div>
				<div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); margin: var(--space-lg) 0; padding-top: var(--space-lg);">
					<ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-sm); font-size: 14px; color: var(--body);">
						<li>✓ Pay in INR</li>
						<li>✓ Security-verified skills</li>
						<li>✓ Instant delivery</li>
						<li>✓ Dispute protection</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<a href="/browse" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; margin-top: var(--space-lg);">Browse Skills →</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="card" style="margin-top: var(--space-3xl); padding: var(--space-2xl); text-align: left; background: var(--canvas-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--hairline);">
			<h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: var(--space-md); color: var(--ink); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
				⚡ Skill Complexity & Credit Usage Policy
			</h2>
			<p style="color: var(--body); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); font-size: 16px;">
				To ensure total transparency, prevent misinformation, and maintain fair compute usage across our AI Agent infrastructure, all interactions with skills on Bodhic AI (via web chat or IDE connectors like Cursor and Claude) consume Bodhic Credits based on an automated AI complexity classification system. Each skill is evaluated during security scanning and assigned a Complexity Level from 1 to 5:
			</p>
			<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-md); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
				<div style="padding: 16px; background: var(--canvas-soft); border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline);">
					<div style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px;">Level 1 — Simple Queries</div>
					<div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);">10 CR <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--mute);">/ chat</span></div>
				</div>
				<div style="padding: 16px; background: var(--canvas-soft); border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline);">
					<div style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px;">Level 2 — Scripting & Formatting</div>
					<div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);">20 CR <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--mute);">/ chat</span></div>
				</div>
				<div style="padding: 16px; background: var(--canvas-soft); border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline);">
					<div style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px;">Level 3 — Data Analysis</div>
					<div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);">40 CR <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--mute);">/ chat</span></div>
				</div>
				<div style="padding: 16px; background: var(--canvas-soft); border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline);">
					<div style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px;">Level 4 — Advanced Engineering</div>
					<div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);">70 CR <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--mute);">/ chat</span></div>
				</div>
				<div style="padding: 16px; background: var(--canvas-soft); border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline);">
					<div style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px;">Level 5 — Multi-Agent Orchestrator</div>
					<div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);">100 CR <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--mute);">/ chat</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p style="color: var(--mute); font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">
				Note: Once you purchase a skill outright, all future interactions with it are completely free and consume 0 credits.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
